    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40518" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-πλάσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spread</i> or <i>plaster</i>
			<i>on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆν σημαντρίδα ἐπιπλάσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.38
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ἐπὶ δῆγμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					9.13.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.86
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>plaster
				up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					875a36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πόρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Sens.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>. <i>mould
				upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποπάνοις ἵππον ποτάμιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.371d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				362f
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναστὸς ἐπιπεπλασμένος</span>
			<i>moulded</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1367
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>. 
				Med.
			,<i>plaster over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηδύν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					89
				</span></i>
			.</div>
